set security address-book global address HOST 10.0.0.1/32
set security address-book global address NET 10.0.1.0/24
set security address-book global address RANGE range-address 10.0.2.1 to 10.0.2.9
set security address-book global address-set ADDRS address HOST
set security address-book global address-set ADDRS address NET
set security address-book global address-set ADDRS address RANGE
set applications application HTTPS_CUSTOM protocol tcp
set applications application HTTPS_CUSTOM destination-port 443
set applications application DNS_RANGE protocol udp
set applications application DNS_RANGE destination-port 53 to 54
set applications application-set APPS application HTTPS_CUSTOM
set applications application-set APPS application DNS_RANGE
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy ALLOW_WEB match source-address ADDRS
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy ALLOW_WEB match destination-address HOST
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy ALLOW_WEB match application APPS
set security policies from-zone trust to-zone untrust policy ALLOW_WEB then permit
set routing-options static route 0.0.0.0/0 next-hop 192.0.2.1